{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16434","headline":"随阳雁歌送兄南游 · 刘商","name":"随阳雁歌送兄南游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞鸿声声飞不住，终日南征向何处。\n大漠穷阴多沍寒，分飞不得长怀安。\n春去秋来年岁疾，湖南蓟北关山难。\n寒飞万里胡天雪，夜度千门汉家月。\n去住应多两地情，东西动作经年别。\n南州风土复何如，春雁归时早寄书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16434.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16434","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}